{"headword":"חֶ֫סֶד","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>2 S 16:17</sup> goodness, kindness;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:12\" href=\"/Genesis.24.12\">Gn 24:12</a> + 85 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָ֑סֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:21\" href=\"/Genesis.39.21\">Gn 39:21</a> + 12 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶסֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.14\">1 S 20:14</a> + 8 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַסְדִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:18\" href=\"/Psalms.59.18\">ψ 59:18</a> + 120 times sfs.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסָדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:11\" href=\"/Genesis.32.11\">Gn 32:11</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַסְדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.3\">Is 55:3</a> + 5 times (Baer<sup>Jes p. 79</sup> Ges<sup>§ 93, R. 1 F.</sup>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסָדַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.14\">Ne 13:14</a> + 10 times sfs.; (not in H or P)."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>of man:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>kindness</em> of men towards men, in doing favours and benefits <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.15\">1 S 20:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.17\">2 S 16:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:5\" href=\"/Psalms.141.5\">ψ 141:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.22\">Pr 19:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.6\">20:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ יהוה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.14\">1 S 20:14</a> <em>the kindness of</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> (such as he shews, Thes MV; that sworn to by oath to Yahweh Mich Dathe; shewn out of reverence to Yahweh Th Ke), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אלהים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.3\">2 S 9:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹרַת־ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.26\">Pr 31:26</a> <em>instruction in kindness, kindly instruction</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשָׂה חֶסֶד עִמָּדִי</span> <em>do or shew kindness</em> (in dealing) <em>with me</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:13\" href=\"/Genesis.20.13\">Gn 20:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:14\" href=\"/Genesis.40.14\">40:14</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.14\">1 S 20:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.2\">2 S 10:2</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עִמִּי</span> in ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.2\">1 Ch 19:2</a>); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:23\" href=\"/Genesis.21.23\">Gn 21:23</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:12\" href=\"/Genesis.24.12\">24:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:14\" href=\"/Genesis.24.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:12\" href=\"/Joshua.2.12\">Jos 2:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:24\" href=\"/Judges.1.24\">Ju 1:24</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:35\" href=\"/Judges.8.35\">8:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.6\">1 S 15:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.5\">2 S 2:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.8\">3:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.1\">9:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.2\">10:2a</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.2\">1 Ch 19:2a</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.2\">1 Ch 19:2b</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.22\">2 Ch 24:22</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.8\">1 S 20:8</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.7\">1 K 2:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא ח׳ לפני</span> <em>obtain kindness before</em> <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:9\" href=\"/Esther.2.9\">Est 2:9</a>, <a data-r