 <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹנֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:12\" href=\"/Psalms.109.12\">ψ 109:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ ורחמים</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.9\">Zc 7:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:9\" href=\"/Daniel.1.9\">Dn 1:9</a>.—(On <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:4\" href=\"/Hosea.6.4\">Ho 6:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:6\" href=\"/Hosea.6.6\">6</a> v. <strong>3</strong> infr.)"}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"(rarely) <em>affection</em> of Isr. to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <em>love to God, piety:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ נְעוּרַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.2\">Je 2:2</a> <em>piety of thy youth</em> (‖ <em>love of thine espousals</em> to Yahweh); poss. also <span dir=\"rtl\">חַסְדְּכֶם כַּעֲנַן־בֹּקֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:4\" href=\"/Hosea.6.4\">Ho 6:4</a> <em>your piety is like a morning cloud</em> (fleeting), and <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי חֶסֶד חָפַצְתִּי וְלאֹ־זָ֑בַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:6\" href=\"/Hosea.6.6\">Ho 6:6</a> <em>for piety I delight in and not in peace-offering</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דעת אלהים</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.22\">1 S 15:22</a>);—so Wü Now Hi (v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.4\">4</a>) Che; Ke Hi (v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.6\">6</a>) al. sub <strong>2</strong> (or <strong>1</strong>);—<span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי חֶסֶד</span> <em>men of piety</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.1\">Is 57:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צַדִּיק</span>); pl. <em>pious acts</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:32\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.32\">2 Ch 32:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.26\">35:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.14\">Ne 13:14</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>lovely appearance:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־חַסְדּוֹ כְּצִיץ הַשָּׂדֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.6\">Is 40:6</a> <em>all its loveliness as the flower of the field</em> (so Thes Hi De Che Di al.; but δόξα 𝔊 1 Pet 1:24 & <em>gloria</em> 𝔙 favour an original reading <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹדוֹ</span> Lo or <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּבֹדוֹ</span> Ew, see Br<sup>MP 375</sup>; Du <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדָרוֹ</span>)."}],"num":"4."}],"num":"I."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>of God: kindness, lovingkindness</em> in condescending to the needs of his creatures. He is <span dir=\"rtl\">חַסְדָּם</span> <em>their goodness, favour</em> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:9\" href=\"/Jonah.2.9\">Jon 2:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַסְדִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:2\" href=\"/Psalms.144.2\">ψ 144:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלֹהֵי חַסְדִּי</span> <em>God of my kindness</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:18\" href=\"/Psalms.59.18\">ψ 59:18</a>; in v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:11\" href=\"/Psalms.59.11\">11</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלֹהַי חַסְדּוֹ</span> <em>my God with his kindness</em> 𝔖 𝔙 Ew Hup De Pe Che Bae; his is the kindness <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:13\" href=\"/Psalms.62.13\">ψ 62:13</a>; it is with him <a data-ref=\"Psalms 130:7\" href=\"/Psalms.130.7\">ψ 130:7</a>; he delights in it <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:18\" href=\"/Micah.7.18\">Mi 7:18</a>."},{"senses":[{"definition":"specif. lovingkindness:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>in redemption from enemies and troubles</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:19\" href=\"/Genesis.19.19\">Gn 19:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:21\" href=\"/Genesis.39.21\">39:21</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:13\" href=\"/Exodus.15.13\">Ex 15:13</a> (song), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.3\">Je 31:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:28\" href=\"/Ezra.7.28\">Ezr 7:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:9\" href=\"/Ezra.9.9\">9:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:8\" href=\"/Psalms.21.8\">ψ 21:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:17\" href=\"/Psalms.31.17\">31:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:22\" href=\"/Psalms.31.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:10\" href=\"/Psalms.32.10\">32:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 3